  <CATEGORY Name="Voices_officer_hub">
    <Entry Name="dialog_woundedsoldier_dialog_woundedsoldier_intro_001_boisrond_001">Hoy?</Entry>
    <Entry Name="dialog_woundedsoldier_dialog_woundedsoldier_intro_002_boisrond_001">Kimdir bormi?</Entry>
    <Entry Name="dialog_woundedsoldier_dialog_woundedsoldier_intro_003_boisrond_001">Men shu yerdaman.</Entry>
    <Entry Name="dialog_woundedsoldier_dialog_woundedsoldier_alt_001_boisrond_001">Henri, he-he, oxirgisi men deb oʻylagandim.</Entry>
    <Entry Name="Dialog_WoundedSoldier_Dialog_WoundedSoldier_Alt_001_Boisrond_002">Eshit, biz shu yerda qamalib qoldik. Oʻsha kalamushxoʻr, harom ofitserlar. Qochib ketishdi. Ortidan chiqish yoʻlini portlatib berkitishdi. Oʻsha choʻchqalar, oʻsha zaharga chalingan ahmoqlar, oʻsha... oʻsha...</Entry>
    <Entry Name="Dialog_WoundedSoldier_Dialog_WoundedSoldier_Alt_001_Boisrond_003">[Yoʻtaladi]</Entry>
    <Entry Name="Dialog_WoundedSoldier_Dialog_WoundedSoldier_Alt_001_Boisrond_004">Ammo senda imkon bor. Chiqish yoʻlini ochish uchun yangi zaryad qoʻy. Tushundingmi?</Entry>
    <Entry Name="Dialog_WoundedSoldier_Dialog_WoundedSoldier_Alt_001_Boisrond_005">Qurolxonada dinamit qulflangan... Portlatgich tutqichi esa yoʻqolgan... Menimcha, qazish joyining bir yerida yana bittasi bor... eshityapsanmi?</Entry>
    <Entry Name="Dialog_WoundedSoldier_Dialog_WoundedSoldier_Alt_001_Boisrond_006">Dinamit va uni portlatadigan tutqich. Sen hali bu yerdan chiqib ketishing mumkin.</Entry>
    <Entry Name="Dialog_WoundedSoldier_Dialog_WoundedSoldier_Alt_001_Boisrond_007">Agar chiqsang, menga bir yaxshilik qil — men uchun bitta ofitserni otib tashla. Koʻzingga koʻringan har qanday ofitserni...</Entry>
    <Entry Name="dialog_woundedsoldier_dialog_woundedsoldier_officers_001_boisrond_001">Henri, he-he, oxirgisi men deb oʻylagandim.</Entry>
    <Entry Name="dialog_woundedsoldier_dialog_woundedsoldier_officers_002_boisrond_001">Biz shu yerda qamalib qoldik, oʻsha kalamushxoʻr ofitserlar qochib, ortidan chiqish yoʻlini portlatib ketishdi.</Entry>
    <Entry Name="dialog_woundedsoldier_dialog_woundedsoldier_escape_001_boisrond_001"> Qochmoqchi boʻlsang, uni qaytadan portlatib ochishing kerak.</Entry>
    <Entry Name="dialog_woundedsoldier_dialog_woundedsoldier_escape_002_boisrond_001"> Qurolxonada dinamit bor, uni portlatadigan tutqich esa qazish joyining bir yerida.</Entry>
    <Entry Name="dialog_woundedsoldier_dialog_woundedsoldier_escape_003_boisrond_001">Ikkalasini ol — chiqib ketasan —</Entry>
    <Entry Name="dialog_woundedsoldier_dialog_woundedsoldier_creature_001_boisrond_001">Laʼnat! Oʻsha narsa men tomon kelyapti.</Entry>
    <Entry Name="dialog_woundedsoldier_dialog_woundedsoldier_creature_002_boisrond_001">Mana. Buni ol.</Entry>
    <Entry Name="dialog_woundedsoldier_dialog_woundedsoldier_creature_003_boisrond_001">Meni tugat, iltimos. Oʻsha maxluqning emas, birodar askarning qoʻlida oʻlgim keladi...</Entry>
    <Entry Name="dialog_woundedsoldier_dialog_woundedsoldier_urge_bullets_001_boisrond_001">Ket endi! Oʻqni ol! Jonimni ol.</Entry>
    <Entry Name="dialog_woundedsoldier_dialog_woundedsoldier_urge_bullets_002_boisrond_001">Tez boʻl! U yaqinlashyapti!</Entry>
    <Entry Name="dialog_woundedsoldier_dialog_woundedsoldier_urge_bullets_003_boisrond_001">Xudo seni kechiradi, Henri. Bu yerda nimaga roʻpara boʻlganimizni biladi!</Entry>
    <Entry Name="dialog_woundedsoldier_dialog_woundedsoldier_urge_bullets_004_boisrond_001">Oʻq omborchada. Senga kerak boʻladi.</Entry>
    <Entry Name="dialog_woundedsoldier_dialog_woundedsoldier_death_001_boisrond_001">YOʻQ! YOʻ-Oʻ-OʻQ! EY XUDO, YORDAM BER! HAROM! SEN</Entry>
    <Entry Name="dialog_woundedsoldier_dialog_woundedsoldier_death_002_boisrond_001">LAʼNAT — SEN —</Entry>
    <Entry Name="dialog_woundedsoldier_dialog_woundedsoldier_death_003_boisrond_001">ILTIMOS YOʻQ — YOʻQ!</Entry>
    <Entry Name="dialog_woundedsoldier_dialog_woundedsoldier_urge_gun_001_boisrond_001">Ol.</Entry>
    <Entry Name="dialog_woundedsoldier_dialog_woundedsoldier_urge_gun_002_boisrond_001">Ol! Hoziroq!</Entry>
    <Entry Name="dialog_woundedsoldier_dialog_woundedsoldier_urge_gun_003_boisrond_001">U kelyapti! Tez boʻl!</Entry>
    <Entry Name="dialog_woundedsoldier_dialog_woundedsoldier_urge_gun_004_boisrond_001">Yolvoraman.</Entry>
    <Entry Name="dialog_woundedsoldier_dialog_woundedsoldier_urge_gun_005_boisrond_001">Sen qilganing yaxshi — oʻsha, oʻsha... oʻsha narsadan koʻra.</Entry>
    <Entry Name="dialog_woundedsoldier_dialog_woundedsoldier_bulletsinfo_001_boisrond_001">Omborchada oʻq bor. Olib kel. Ishni bitir, iltimos.</Entry>
  </CATEGORY>
